{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "fleet-rules",
  "version": 2,
  "placeholders": [
    "/raceFormat/startRow/depthLineLengths",
    "/raceFormat/startRow/spreadLineLengths",
    "/raceFormat/startRow/polarSpeedFraction",
    "/raceFormat/startRow/minimumSpacingHullLengths",
    "/raceFormat/edgeSpeedRetention",
    "/raceFormat/beatSizing/calibrationFactor"
  ],
  "builderValues": [
    "/incidents/nearMissSweep/headingSamples",
    "/incidents/nearMissSweep/stepTicks",
    "/incidents/nearMissSweep/clearanceHullLengths",
    "/incidents/escape/candidates",
    "/incidents/escape/startTickOffset",
    "/incidents/escape/initiallySeconds",
    "/markRoomGiven",
    "/onABeat"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The rules configuration for a v1.0 fleet race (#73): every replay-affecting rules and race-format value, recorded in each race log by ref (ADR 0004).",
    "Rules in 2025 RRS numbering. Units: seconds, degrees, ticks; sizes in hull lengths of the race's boat class, line lengths or fractions of the beat. Schema: docs/rules-file.md.",
    "builderValues (JSON Pointers above) are the values the spec leaves to the builder: the near-miss sweep geometry, the escape simulation's candidates, start tick and 'initially' window, and the mark-room-given and 'on a beat' tests.",
    "placeholders await tuning: the start row (#35), edge speed retention (#82) and the beat-sizing calibration factor (#80, #105).",
    "Version 2 is version 1 plus raceFormat.startRow.minimumSpacingHullLengths (schema 2, #85): the closest a squeeze of the start row off land (#82) brings neighbours, centre to centre, so they stay clear ahead and clear astern (#35) with a quarter of a hull between them. A placeholder, like the rest of the start row."
  ],
  "incidents": {
    "nearMissSweep": {
      "headingDegrees": 10,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "headingSamples": 5,
      "stepTicks": 1,
      "clearanceHullLengths": 0
    },
    "escape": {
      "horizonSeconds": 2,
      "candidates": {
        "rudder": [-1, -0.5, 0, 0.5, 1],
        "ease": [false, true]
      },
      "startTickOffset": 1,
      "initiallySeconds": 2
    },
    "separationHullLengths": 2,
    "lastPointOfCertaintySeconds": 0.5
  },
  "zone": {
    "radiusHullLengths": 3
  },
  "markRoomGiven": {
    "roundingDistanceHullLengths": 1,
    "clearanceHullLengths": 0.25
  },
  "onABeat": {
    "maxTrueWindAngleDegrees": 60,
    "windwardLegOnly": true
  },
  "raceFormat": {
    "startSequenceSeconds": 60,
    "penalty": {
      "startSeconds": 15,
      "completeSeconds": 30,
      "startedTurnDegrees": 30
    },
    "protestWindowSeconds": 15,
    "finishWindowSeconds": 120,
    "timeLimitSeconds": 960,
    "startLine": {
      "hullLengthsPerBoat": 1.25,
      "minimumMetres": 42
    },
    "leewardGate": {
      "aboveLineBeatDivisor": 6,
      "widthHullLengths": 10
    },
    "offsetMark": {
      "toPortHullLengths": 12
    },
    "raceArea": {
      "acrossAxisBeatFraction": 0.75,
      "belowLineLineLengths": 1,
      "aboveWindwardBeatFraction": 0.25
    },
    "startRow": {
      "depthLineLengths": 0.5,
      "spreadLineLengths": 1.5,
      "trueWindAngleDegrees": 90,
      "polarSpeedFraction": 1,
      "minimumSpacingHullLengths": 1.25
    },
    "edgeSpeedRetention": 0.3,
    "beatSizing": {
      "leaderSeconds": 480,
      "maxMetres": 360,
      "calibrationFactor": 1
    }
  }
}
